sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant N as Next.js Server
  participant I as Identity Service
  B->>N: Submit credentials / OAuth callback
  N->>I: Validate identity
  I-->>N: Session result
  N-->>B: Secure HttpOnly cookie
  B->>N: Protected request
  N->>I: Validate session and permission
  I-->>N: Authorised
  N-->>B: Rendered response
